@startuml
!theme plain
title Overall System Architecture (3-Tier)

node "Client Layer (Frontend)" {
  [React (Vite)] as Frontend
  note right of Frontend
    - **Language**: JavaScript/JSX
    - **State**: Redux Toolkit
    - **UI Library**: Ant Design
    - **Routing**: React Router
    - **Styling**: Sass / CSS
  end note
}

node "Server Layer (Backend)" {
  [Node.js + Express API] as Backend
  note right of Backend
    - **Language**: TypeScript
    - **Docs**: Swagger UI
    - **Auth**: JWT + Bcrypt
    - **Logging**: Pino
  end note
}

node "Data Layer" {
  database "PostgreSQL" as DB
  [Prisma ORM] as ORM
}

cloud "External Services" {
  [S3 / MinIO] as Storage
  [Nodemailer / Mailhog] as Email
}

Frontend --> Backend : HTTP/JSON Requests
Backend --> ORM : Type-safe Queries
ORM --> DB : SQL
Backend --> Storage : Image Uploads
Backend --> Email : Transactional Emails

@enduml
